    "created_at": "2016-03-28T09:32:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-28T09:32:05Z",
    "body": "Hmm, From Jonas's comments, #253, I don't quite understand where the difference in handling (consideration) of credentials between wildcarded ACEH and the others (wildcarded ACAH, etc.) comes from. Maybe I'm missing something?\n\nJonas's https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/253#issuecomment-200098479 is assuming that the server doesn't alter the values of the non-simple headers based on the received cookie value?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
