    "created_at": "2016-05-05T00:54:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T00:54:36Z",
    "body": "It would help to see examples of real-world applications using ACEH to evaluate the need and safety of allowing '*' for credentialed requests. I'd rather respond to a demonstrated need than offer it just because we think it might be useful. It's a footgun to be sure. \n",
